{"id":"89e240fe2a8a5b0c","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-halting-language.md","title":"停机语言","display":"df-halting-language — 停机语言","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-halting-language","aliases":["28-df-halting-language"],"display":"df-halting-language — 停机语言","depends_on":["[[28-df-tm]]","[[28-df-computation]]","[[28-df-godel-numbering]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; §1.5.1 and Theorem 1.11","source_printed_pages":"23","source_pdf_pages":"49","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-halting-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-halting-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-halting-language — 停机语言"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"256220eba4eba968\" href=\"?note=256220eba4eba968\" title=\"28-df-computation\">28-df-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b54d75aae768415e\" href=\"?note=b54d75aae768415e\" title=\"28-df-godel-numbering\">28-df-godel-numbering</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach; §1.5.1 and Theorem 1.11"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"23"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"49"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a> 定义的确定型机器集。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner M\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner M\\urcorner\\)</span> 与有效二串配对编码见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b54d75aae768415e\" href=\"?note=b54d75aae768415e\" title=\"28-df-godel-numbering\">28-df-godel-numbering</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Halt}_M(x)\">\\(\\operatorname{Halt}_M(x)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"256220eba4eba968\" href=\"?note=256220eba4eba968\" title=\"28-df-computation\">28-df-computation</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HALT}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner,x\\rangle:M\\in\\mathrm{TM},\\ x\\in\\Sigma^*,\\ \\operatorname{Halt}_M(x)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{HALT}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner,x\\rangle:M\\in\\mathrm{TM},\\ x\\in\\Sigma^*,\\ \\operatorname{Halt}_M(x)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里只对确定型机器取停机语言，因而Halt的统一前缀长度界等价于该唯一运行进入停机状态。无效编码不属于集合。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§1.5.1 and Theorem 1.11；印刷 pp.23 / PDF pp.49。本次核对范围：定义陈述与本地形式化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","ancho