ndecidability]]。"},{"id":"ab29eca0895539ff","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HALT}$ 见 [[28-df-halting-language]]；$\\mathrm{TM}$、$L(M)$、$\\operatorname{Halt}$ 使用本目录确定型机器接口。"}],"outgoing":["1965e2b0765554c9","256220eba4eba968","b54d75aae768415e"]}